    {
      "id": 211416,
      "name": "Jeysie",
      "username": "Jeysie",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-12-21T18:55:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Off the top of my head for portraits:</p><p>I find it interesting in general that the men suffer way more clothing damage in their under-10 portraits than the ladies, culminating in Chrono-Ranger's ending up shirtless which I can't say I mind in the slightest.</p><p>Bonus points though for original Parse who as near as I can tell suffers naught but some dainty cracks in her glasses.</p><p>I really like AZ and Bunker's Termi-Nation portraits, as we rarely get to see either of their faces and they're more visible in these looks.</p><p>Freedom Five Tachyon is wicked awesome. Her entire facial expression and pose just exudes attitude and \"I'm the badass in town and don't you forget it\".</p><p>Freedom Five Wraith's incap gets points for how melodramatic it is, stylishly hiding her face.</p><p>Visionary Unleashed's incap is so pretty and serene looking.</p><p>Dark Conductor Argent Adept's under-10 portrait is one of <em>the</em> downright freakiest things in the game and I love it.</p><p>As for cutscene messages:</p><p>Freedom Six Bunker and Fright Train's nemesis messages are utterly hilarious; basically them going \"WTF?\" \"WTF?\" at each other with train puns (and is basically 100% of the reason I hope we get special messages for the OblivAeon heroes and their normal selves).</p><p>Prime Wardens Argent Adept and Akash'Bhuta is pretty much a mutual Badass Awesome Boast deal.</p><p>Just about every single Captain Cosmic and Infinitor message makes me weepy-eyed for how sweet they are. XTREME Cosmic and Infinitor in particular is surprisingly sweet considering the source.</p><p>XTREME Cosmic's normal message, on the other hand, is just downright hilarious.</p><p>Finally, Freedom Five AZ and Team Miss Info is also really sweet for AZ calling the F5 his family.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:41:58.322Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
