      "cooked": "<p>Dark Conductor Argent Adept's sub-10 HP portrait is the most memorable of the Fall of the Variants stuff for sure.</p><p>I enjoyed F5 Tachyon vs. Iron Legacy as a nemesis quote, and also enjoyed Friction's quote vs. F5 Tachyon.</p><p>F5 Legacy's quote vs. Baron Blade from this week's one-shot was pretty funny.&nbsp;</p><p>Bunker's lines aren't super interesting, but I did enjoy F5 Bunker vs. Fright Train for him calling FT out on his one-track mind.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
