      "username": "Jeysie",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-12-27T14:32:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Iron Legacy's storyline in Sentinels is arguably the most tragic one in the whole thing. I wonder if we'll ever get a podcast detailing the entire event, since it seems like pretty much literally everyone who's not Ambuscade ends up being thoroughly miserable (or dead, or miserable and then dead).</p><p>Deadline's victory screen is also a picture of a being who's not in the slightest happy with the end results.</p><p>Both of Gloomweaver's victory screens are freakily awesome.</p><p>La Captain's victory screen is nicely classy.</p>",
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
